/*
  Winter theme - a snowy moon base under the Earth and a blue nebula, with a
  light snowfall (res/images/winter.jpg, the bright ground darkened). Icy cyan
  frames, gold totals, and holiday green for money coming in.

  The layout is res/flapxcoin.qss, below its variables; the base colours come
  from the theme table in guiutil.cpp.
*/

